#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:119
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "Hoe het werkt"

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:121
msgid "Enquiry & Scope: "
msgstr "Onderzoek en toepassingsgebied:"

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:121
msgid ""
"Share dates, location and audience size; pick a pop-up Irish pub or mobile "
"Irish bar format."
msgstr "Delen data, locatie en publieksgrootte; kies een pop-up Ierse pub of mobiele Ierse bar formaat."

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:122
msgid "Planning: "
msgstr "Planning:"

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:122
msgid ""
"We align on power/water (if required), service windows and venue compliance."
msgstr "We richten ons op stroom/water (indien nodig), serviceramen en naleving van locaties."

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:123
msgid "Setup: "
msgstr "Instellingen:"

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:123
msgid "Efficient build, safety checks, clean branded presentation."
msgstr "Efficiënte bouw, veiligheidscontroles, schone merkpresentatie."

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:124
msgid "Service: "
msgstr "Dienst:"

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:124
msgid ""
"Perfect pours, queue-smart staffing, friendly pace—and the odd song if the "
"room invites it."
msgstr "Perfect gieten, wachtrij-slim personeel, vriendelijk tempo en het oneven lied als de kamer nodigt."

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:125
msgid "Breakdown: "
msgstr "Verdeling:"

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:125
msgid "Fast teardown; we leave the space as we found it."
msgstr "Snelle afbraak, we verlaten de ruimte zoals we die vonden."

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:128
msgid "Why It Works"
msgstr "Waarom het werkt"

#: .\home\templates\home\aboutus.html:130
