#: .\home\templates\home\index.html:51
msgid ""
"Since 1986, we've been recreating a little bit of Ireland at events across "
"continental EU - delivering reliable, premium event bar hire and Irish bar "
"event hire that feels like a real Irish pub. Our experienced Irish "
"bartenders serve Guinness on draught and other Irish drinks with pace, "
"professionalism, and a generous dose of Irish banter."
